---
description: Summarise the findings under a directory using an extension tool
mode: subagent
tools:
  - read
  - finding_store
params:
  findings_dir: string
---
// `tools:` mixes a built-in (`read`) with an extension-registered Pi tool
// (`finding_store`, contributed by an installed Pi extension). This theta is
// `mode: subagent`, so the invocation runs the WHOLE callee in a spawned child
// `pi` process that loads the same extensions. Two reach paths work here:
//
// Code-side reach: theta CODE calls `finding_store` directly. In subagent
// mode a code-side extension-tool call is dispatched deterministically
// through the child's own host agent loop (PIC-64 rung 2 — host-loop
// dispatch): the code-supplied arguments are used verbatim, zero model tokens
// are spent, and the result returns to code like any tool call. The
// fabricated dispatch turn stays in the child's private, discarded session —
// nothing reaches the user's transcript. (The same call from a PROMPT-mode
// theta also works — since 0.11.0 — but dispatches through the user's live
// session; see prompt-extension-tool.theta.)
let check = finding_store({ op: "validate", findingsDir: findings_dir })?

// Model-facing reach: the MODEL may also call `finding_store` during the
// query's tool loop below — the callable set's host-tool names become the
// child session's active-tool allowlist (a `.theta` callable never enters it).
//
// Code-side dispatch is fail-closed only where NO rung is establishable — a
// host missing the required Pi surfaces or backing host session; there the
// theta refuses to load with `theta/load/extension-tool-unreachable`. (A
// `subagent fn` inline body is not such a context: its code-side calls
// dispatch through the process's backing host session.) Listing an extension
// tool whose extension is not installed is a different load-time error
// (`theta/load/unknown-tool`), not a silent no-op.
@`Using the store under ${findings_dir} (schema check: ${check}), list the
findings with finding_store, read any file it references, and report how many
findings are still open in one sentence.`
